' UC-AGA-06 — Review Facility User Access Change Request

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access access-change review function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrative authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present authorization failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Retrieve pending access-change requests;
  if (Pending requests exist?) then (No [EF-02])
    :Present no-Pending-requests notice;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    :Present list of Pending requests;
  endif
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select request to review;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Retrieve request & current access context;
if (Request available & still Pending?) then (No [EF-03])
  :Present current request status;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present request details and current access;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.2 Review request details;
if (Review info valid?) then (No [EF-04])
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present validation issue; hold decision;
  kill
else (Yes)
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Decision type?) then (Approve [3.0])
  :Select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.1 Present approval confirmation prompt;
elseif (Modify and Approve [AF-01])
  :Modify details & select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Validate modifications & present confirmation;
else (Reject [AF-02])
  :Select Reject;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present rejection confirmation prompt;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm decision?) then (No / Cancel [EF-05])
  :Cancel review decision;
  kill
else (Yes [3.2])
  :Confirm decision;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Validate final status & apply review decision;
if (Still eligible for decision?) then (No [EF-06])
  :Present decision-not-applicable result;
  kill
elseif (Processing failed?) then (Yes [EF-07])
  :Present review-failure result;
  kill
else (Success)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record review decision & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present resulting approved/rejected status;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Acknowledge review outcome;
stop
@enduml
